yaoer-hou:p001","quote":"侯安都字成師，始興曲江人也。世為郡著姓。父文捍，","subject_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-008-zhangyaoer-hou:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-chenshu-008-zhangyaoer-hou:p001:m0021","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-chenshu-008-zhangyaoer-hou:p001","surface":"父文捍","start":20,"end":23}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"侯安都本傳，父名依本見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-nan012-zhangyaoer-s-father","subject_person_id":"liq_ch0_j1l_A","object_person_id":"liq_ch0_j1l","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父捍","nan012_zhangyaoer_reading":"s-father","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-066","source_id":"s-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou-ws1748897","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou:p001","quote":"侯安都字成師，始興曲江人也，爲郡著姓。父捍，","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou:p001:m0020","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-066-zhangyaoer-hou:p001","surface":"父捍","start":19,"end":21}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"侯安都本傳，父名依本見證。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002","text":"高祖自廣州南征交阯，命后與衡陽王昌隨世祖由海道歸于長城。侯景之亂，高祖下至豫章，后為景所囚。景平，而高祖為長城縣公，后拜夫人。及高祖踐祚，永定元年立為皇后。追贈后父景明特進、金紫光祿大夫，加金章紫綬，拜后母蘇安吉縣君。二年，安吉君卒，與后父合葬吳興。明年，追封后父為廣德縣侯，邑五百戶，謚曰溫。高祖崩，后與中書舍人蔡景歷定計，祕不發喪，召世祖入纂，事在蔡景歷及侯安都傳。世祖即位，尊后為皇太后，宮曰慈訓。廢帝即位，尊后為太皇太后。光大二年，后下令黜廢帝為臨海王，命高宗嗣位。太建元年，尊后為皇太后。二年三月景申，崩于紫極殿，時年六十五。遺令喪事所須，並從儉約，諸有饋奠，不得用牲牢。其年四月，羣臣上謚曰宣太后，祔葬萬安陵。","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-007-zhangyaoer:p002:m0016","surface":"昌","start":16,"end":17,"person_id":"3eu_ixs_h1w_B","kind":"person","status":"contextu